        <briefdescription>
<para>Evaluates whether <computeroutput>plan</computeroutput> should be executed given cost thresholds. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Steps:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>If the guardrail is disabled, return allow unconditionally.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Derive effective cost: use <computeroutput>plan.estimated_cost_ms</computeroutput> when non-zero, otherwise call <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_tensor_rag_cost_model_1a4b45753bd46076c70a8b54984dc0035b" kindref="member">TensorRagCostModel::estimate()</ref> with default config adapted to <computeroutput>plan.num_chunks</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Select threshold: <computeroutput>max_cross_dc_cost_ms</computeroutput> for cross-DC plans, <computeroutput>max_cost_ms</computeroutput> otherwise.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Deny with structured reason and THEMIS_WARN when cost &gt; threshold.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The raw query string (UTF-8). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>plan</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Federated plan to evaluate. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_guardrail_decision" kindref="compound">GuardrailDecision</ref> describing the allow/deny outcome. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
