    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe federated retrieval cost guardrail. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_tensor_rag_cost_model" kindref="compound">TensorRagCostModel</ref> to estimate the end-to-end latency of a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_federated_query_plan" kindref="compound">FederatedQueryPlan</ref> and denies execution when the estimate exceeds the configured SLO threshold. All public methods are <computeroutput>const</computeroutput> and therefore safe to call concurrently from multiple threads without external locking.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">themis::rag::TensorRagCostModel<sp/>model;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">themis::rag::RetrievalGuardrailConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.<ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_retrieval_guardrail_config_1aafcc26f10f70703cc75dfd21ea5fcfa8" kindref="member">max_cost_ms</ref><sp/>=<sp/>300.0f;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">themis::rag::RetrievalGuardrail<sp/>guard(model,<sp/>cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">themis::rag::FederatedQueryPlan<sp/>plan;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plan.<ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_federated_query_plan_1ae7572eccca3ca81e8218171e3052fb6e" kindref="member">num_chunks</ref><sp/>=<sp/>50;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>decision<sp/>=<sp/>guard.checkFederatedCost(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;SELECT<sp/>...&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>plan);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!decision.allow)<sp/>{<sp/>log(decision.deny_reason);<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
